  "description": "\"M-My symptoms are a bit different from my subordinates... Down there... it stands way too often.\" \n\nHelia is the only witch in the Velnus territory. She receives a special commission from the members of the stationed Red Hawk Knight Order. The request is to make a medicine that will break their curse. \n\nHowever, the captain of the knight order seems to be suffering from a very unusual curse, quite unlike his men...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002741)",
